# J12 — Activity / viz auto-open
# Run work; Activity must auto-open. The viz gallery must auto-open ONLY when
# an artifact has content (no empty-page open); every page with no backing
# artifact must show its empty_hint guidance line, never dummy content.
name: Activity and viz auto-open
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch:
wait-for: 25 CHOOSE A TARGET
keys: d
wait: 2
snap: activity-auto-open
expect: ACTIVITY
ask: Did Activity auto-open when work started (auto_open_activity default true)?
wait-for: 90 run completed
wait: 2
snap: post-run-deck
ask: Post-run — did the output deck/viz switch honor the content gate (scan→Heatmap only when findings > 0), with no empty page auto-opened?
keys: Escape
wait: 1
submit: viz
wait: 2
snap: viz-page-1
# Strict input modes: printable/view navigation only operates after F2.
keys: F2
keys: Tab
wait: 1
snap: viz-page-2
keys: Tab
wait: 1
snap: viz-page-3
keys: Tab
wait: 1
snap: viz-page-4
keys: Tab
wait: 1
snap: viz-page-5
ask: Tab through all five viz pages — does every page with no backing artifact show one honest empty_hint guidance line (never dummy/fabricated content)?
keys: Escape
